  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做生理"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">論真，生理人若kan-na tuì頂手盤便品tńg--來，照本疊--寡，就隨賣--出-去，tse內底ê所費總khioh-khioh--leh，揣有一割ê利純thang袋入來褲lok仔燒燒，就真正土地公有保庇，規暝暢kah目屎膏kiōng-beh tin--落-來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iah若tng銷、時行ê大色貨，價siàu lóng mā削kah貼底貼底，刣kah流血流滴tsiah有生理thang做；有時tsūn koh tio̍h兼開發票hōo人客報銷就慘--ah，趁有空五（khòng-ngóo）ê利頭，就ē bih tī壁角偷笑；m̄-koh，若kā稅金、配達ê運費扣掉，khîng有空一就算bē-bái--ah，正經是beh哭無目屎，講to無人beh信；總--是，bua̍t趁ê貨仔，若tsiâu用現金leh買賣，iáu有tsiok濟人搶beh做，反顛倒若無趁kah半sián，食飽換iau ê生理，無人肯做。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">加工--過，tsiah-koh賣hōo下手ê貨仔，決定ài掠khah好趁，料錢、人工、稅金、運費扣掉mài算，若趁無加二、加三來食燒、食冷，實在bē和盤；加工ê頭尾愈長、愈濟kái，就愈好趁，小可換樣、改裝，外形變khah suí款，親像查某人穿衫、妝thānn án-ne，顛倒ē-tàng kā人客pián khah濟錢tńg--來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">貨仔若賣hōo hit款khah大間，有tshiànn會計、出納ê工廠、公司，交關lóng用賒--ê，月底kā欠siàu láng倚--來，做一kái清算，過月開--出-來--ê是一張三個月後兌現ê期票，頭尾總扯，四月日tsiah看著銀票仔，命若khah短--ê，凡勢領無、食無，tsiah是冤枉！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊若衰--到-tè--ah，種pû仔生菜瓜hōo伊倒--去，四月日ê貨款即時變phànn-siàu，錢額若細，是iáu無tsùn-būn--著，pōng著大注--ê，tsit聲，無去跳海kám就ē煞？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/zN92e0\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/zN92e0</a>）</span></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgS1n7PsnpmSl9qyhPMu0sFTeOobOuAAhlUBTPTEIR94AQ6TGjtF5wdRj8qgwoLq7FbHMXxeZEM5EVyPJxBO_1aQrOyZpCT95mICxeaMVBl0zrKrW7Sarvdjg-xaUvbj8r9BhvodpHgJBTkze8SFeW3eXyO_wVbooUEM8lhNFA0zzoTxati0k1ioQVkGA/s1424/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgS1n7PsnpmSl9qyhPMu0sFTeOobOuAAhlUBTPTEIR94AQ6TGjtF5wdRj8qgwoLq7FbHMXxeZEM5EVyPJxBO_1aQrOyZpCT95mICxeaMVBl0zrKrW7Sarvdjg-xaUvbj8r9BhvodpHgJBTkze8SFeW3eXyO_wVbooUEM8lhNFA0zzoTxati0k1ioQVkGA/w450-h640/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgppov2FSIjnPj10qgQg5_bPi7pdfQIoXMu2G7wlWQ-0b8NCzMYqW_s7oN2yz4CsVP9fvsxMnUxewH3FvGlZs6XNa93qXAAtedHj74aUtwHNMsu5XwZMD5qUlckz0ckonmaM8Zb4KYB8Cxxspc_cVdQZcugM6FxREVtAAXsN9JbczhkLBsSQiGG_pbozA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1343%E6%9C%9F_05.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgppov2FSIjnPj10qgQg5_bPi7pdfQIoXMu2G7wlWQ-0b8NCzMYqW_s7oN2yz4CsVP9fvsxMnUxewH3FvGlZs6XNa93qXAAtedHj74aUtwHNMsu5XwZMD5qUlckz0ckonmaM